#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:396
msgid "Available/Visible Memory Access Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:398
msgid ""
"These builtins perform 128-bit global or flat memory loads and stores with "
"available/visible (AV) semantics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:402
msgid "``__builtin_amdgcn_av_load_b128``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:410
#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:426
msgid "**Target Features:** flat-global-insts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:412
msgid ""
"Loads 128 bits (4 x i32) from the pointer ``ptr``. The pointer must be in "
"the global or generic address space. The ``scope`` argument specifies the "
"synchronization scope using a ``__MEMORY_SCOPE_*`` constant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:418
msgid "``__builtin_amdgcn_av_store_b128``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:428
msgid ""
"Stores 128 bits (4 x i32) of ``data`` to the pointer ``ptr``. The pointer "
"must be in the global or generic address space. The ``scope`` argument "
"specifies the synchronization scope using a ``__MEMORY_SCOPE_*`` constant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:435
msgid "Bit Manipulation Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:437
msgid "These builtins perform bit-manipulation operations within a wavefront."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:440
msgid "``__builtin_amdgcn_s_bitreplicate``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:448
#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:6553
msgid "**Target Features:** gfx9-insts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:450
msgid ""
"Replicates each bit of the 32-bit ``src`` operand into two adjacent bits of "
"a 64-bit result. Bit ``i`` of the input is copied to bits ``2*i`` and "
"``2*i+1`` of the output. The operand must be uniform across the wavefront. A "
"divergent value gives an undefined result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:458
msgid "Conversion Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:460
msgid ""
"These builtins provide access to AMDGPU conversion instructions, including "
"conversions between standard floating-point types, integer types and packed "
"low-precision formats."
