"using the scale factor ``scale``, then converts the values to a packed 32-"
"component FP6 value, returned as a 6-element vector of 32-bit unsigned "
"integers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUBuiltinReference.rst:649
msgid "Prefetch Builtins"
msgstr ""

